window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>***This is a dual narrated and multi-cast novella set within the Mystics and Mayhem world and best listened to after Fractured Mates***</p> <p>A broken mate, a determined wolf, and a bond that can’t be broken. For six years, River has been missing. It doesn’t matter that we only knew each other for mere weeks before he disappeared. He’s my fated mate and everything I’ve done since he’s been gone has been to get him back. When it’s time to bring him home, I don’t hesitate to go after him. Yet, I know the moment I find River that he’s no longer the man I first met. His heart and mind have been shattered by the darkness of our world, but that doesn’t change our bond. River is still mine, and I’ll do whatever it takes to help him heal, even if it means walking away so he can find himself again.</p>"; 
